h revenue growing 8%/yr across its filed history. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["Diageo plc is a large-cap consumer defensive business with a $56.6B market cap on $28.3B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +8% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 16% against a 7% cost of capital, a 9-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it, with gross margins sitting at 41%.","On the balance sheet, debt is moderate at 3.3\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, serviceable in normal conditions but worth watching through a downturn, and interest coverage runs at 5.0\u00d7.","Shareholder yield of 4.0% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 2.5\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Payout ratio looks stretched \u2014 the dividend\u2019s own margin of safety is thin","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Carries a 1528% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":15.284881383192602},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Slow-motion taste and channel shifts \u2014 private label, Gen-Z health preferences, or a DTC disruption can erode decade-old brand moats without a single dramatic quarter.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Input cost inflation from agricultural commodities \u2014 when raw materials spike, pass-through pricing lags and margin compression is immediate.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 and health-trend demand destruction \u2014 weight-loss drugs and wellness shifts are structurally reducing consumption in snack, beverage, and packaged food categories.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 13% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading at a 31% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","28 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Consumer Defensive sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 15% over 3 months","Consumer Defensive ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Diageo (LSE:DGE) Stock Sees Modest Fair Value Lift After Mixed Q1 Analyst Revisions","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/diageo-lse-dge-stock-sees-180825820.html","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795802905.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.398,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Is Diageo (LSE:DGE) Keeping Income Flowing As It Confirms The Sterling Final Dividend?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/uk/stocks/consumer/is-diageo-lsedge-keeping-income-flowing-as-it-confirms-the-sterling-final-dividend","date":"2026-11-26","timestamp":1795691160.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.477,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"FTSE 100 Diageo (LSE:DGE) Fixes Its Final Dividend in Sterling for Shareholders","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/uk/stocks/bluechip/ftse-100-diageo-lsedge-fixes-its-final-dividend-in-sterling-for-shareholders","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795588500.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"Design Bridge and Partners Hires Higgins As Global President","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/media-advertising/articles/design-bridge-partn